<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
      <meta charset="UTF-8">
      <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
      <link href="https://unpkg.com/tailwindcss@^1.0/dist/tailwind.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  </head>
  <body>
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center h-screen bg-gray-300">
          <div class="w-full max-w-sm object-center bg-white shadow rounded p-4">
              <strong>
              Hi, {{name}}
              </strong> <br/><br/>

              <p class="text-sm">
                  Thanks for signing up for mobyhub! <br/>
                  You signed up using the key: {{key}}, which has now been used. <br/><br/>
                  Keep in mind that if you abuse/break our <a href="https://mobyhub-pipeline.glitch.me/tos" class="text-blue-700">TOS</a>, you risk getting blacklisted. <br/><br/>


                  You can find the list of supported games and commands <a href="https://mobyhub-pipeline.glitch.me/supportedgames" class="text-blue-700">here</a>,
                  And you can get the loadstring here: <br/>
              </p>

              <code class="bg-gray-100 text-xs focus:outline-none focus:shadow-outline border border-gray-300 rounded-lg py-2 px-4 block w-full appearance-none leading-normal shadow text-gray-700">loadstring(game:HttpGet(('https://mobyhub-pipeline.glitch.me/loadstring'),true))()</code>
          </div>
      </div>
  </body>
</html>